deo></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game caters to all skill levels, making it a perfect choice for students and math enthusiasts alike. Whether you\u2019re a beginner looking for a fun way to practice or a pro looking for a challenge, Times Trials is right for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >School Your Friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiply the fun with multiplayer! Versus mode lets you show off your cool math skills.\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/5c9f16307d964b5755b2edc64c488054.poster.avif?t=1749637350\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/5c9f16307d964b5755b2edc64c488054.webm?t=1749637350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/5c9f16307d964b5755b2edc64c488054.mp4?t=1749637350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cute Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/70a4e43f590a73fcc71c7e0b429d6084.poster.avif?t=1749637350\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/70a4e43f590a73fcc71c7e0b429d6084.webm?t=1749637350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/70a4e43f590a73fcc71c7e0b429d6084.mp4?t=1749637350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Made by Excellent People</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Times Trials has had the honor to have industry veterans be a part of the development. These veterans have come from titles such as Mickey Mouse Funhouse, beatmania IIDX, and Deemo II.</p>",
    "short_description": "Flex your 200 IQ with Times Trials - an arcade-style block-dropping puzzle game. Arrange falling numbers to solve equations and win. Style on your friends in versus multiplayer, or wrinkle your brain in singleplayer.",
